---
description: Citation and reference standards
globs:
  - "docs/**/*.md"
  - "case-studies/**/*.md"
  - "references/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Prefer primary sources: academic papers, official documentation, engineering blogs from system authors.

Every substantive chapter must include a References section.

Distinguish between:
- formal guarantees (from papers or specs)
- implementation choices (from production systems)
- anecdotal operational experience

Add entries to references/ YAML files for books, papers, talks, and postmortems.
